             Help: Keys
 Arrow Keys     -       Move
  vi Keys

. [dot] / 5     -       Do nothing
        
    1-9         -       Equip items
     f          -       Fire / Use item
   asdzc        -       Equip wetware

     x          -       Examine / target
     e          -       Auto-explore
   < >          -       Walk to elevator
 (shift)L       -       Read logs
 (shift)C       -       Key cards
        
 (shift)M       -       Message history
 (shift)F       -       Full screen mode
 (shift)Q       -       Quit the game
     ?          -       This help
